note Keyword tables, space-separated, in newline-separated sections. First: the pinned seed's 66
note words (omc.om 29b12760 fn kw), refused 16 in every mode. Second: the 93 further words of the
note seeded frontend's fn kw (omega-mv e5b32567), refused 16 in seeded modes. Third: the 6 words
note draft-1049 (7e93ca8e) adds to fn kw, refused 16 in its modes E and J. OM-2-only words (kw2) and
note target-conditional words are left to the seeded frontend, which runs first in tools/bridge-seeded.
fn seedkw to ulong
n = get tl 0
s = get ts 0
k = len kwlist
i = ulong 0
e = add n 1
lim = add get seeded 0 get fnext 0
while lt e k
if eq get kwlist i 10
if eq lim 0
ret 0
end
lim = sub lim 1
end
if eq get kwlist i 32
if eq get kwlist e 32
j = ulong 0
m = ulong 1
while lt j n
a = get kwlist add add i 1 j
if ne a get src add s j
m = ulong 0
end
j = add j 1
end
if eq m 1
ret 1
end
end
end
i = add i 1
e = add e 1
end
ret 0
end

