note Exact conversion adapted unchanged from omega-mv draft1049, 7e93ca8e, seed/omc/omc.om.
note e5 profile keeps fbits scaling above; only the explicit next profile calls fexact.
note fbmul: limbs fbn[o, o+40) times k (k < 2^32, so each limb step fits 64 bits); the product must fit
note in 40 limbs. Returns its bit length, so fbmul o 1 only measures.
fn fbmul o ulong k ulong to ulong
c = ulong 0
t = ulong 0
i = ulong 0
